msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 1,800.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Absorbs 100% of damage dealt as HP<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Increases <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Oath Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 10"
