msgid "Restores target's HP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 4,000<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Restores to self 50% of HP restored to target if target is a party member"
