msgid "Delivers an attack to target.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Action:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Hard Slash</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 1,000<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
