msgid "Delivers an attack to target.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Action:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Disembowel</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 600<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Damage over time<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 200<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 18s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Increases damage you deal target by 20%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 21s<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
