msgid "Delivers a jumping attack with a potency of 800.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Reduces the recast time of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mirage Dive</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 15 seconds<br>Cannot be executed while bound."
