msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 2,600.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Increases <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Kenki Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 20<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants a stack of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Meditation</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Can be stacked up to 3 times.<br>Shares a recast timer with <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Tenka Goken</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
