msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 1,400.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Reduces the recast time of both <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Gauss Round</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ricochet</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 7.5s<br>Can only be executed when firearm is <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Overheated</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
