msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 800.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>If target is suffering from a <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Wildfire</ui-edge-color></ui-color> effect inflicted by you, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Blank</ui-edge-color></ui-color> potency is tripled<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15-yalm knockback"
