msgctxt "ActionTransient:8866:0:0"
msgid "Deals fire damage with a potency of 1,800 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Astral Fire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, increasing damage dealt by 20%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s"
