msgid "Deals ice damage with a potency of 1,200 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Restores 2,000 MP for each enemy hit<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Umbral Ice</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, reducing spell cast and recast time by 20%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s"
