msgid "Restores 2,000 MP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Aetherflow III</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Cannot use while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Dreadwyrm Trance</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
