msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 2,000 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br>Can only be executed while <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Demi-Bahamut</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is summoned.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
