msgid "Deals wind damage with a potency of 1,800.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Increases <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>White Mana</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 15<br>Can only be cast while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Dualcast</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
