msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 1,200 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Increases both <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Black Mana</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>White Mana</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 5 for each enemy hit<br>Can only be cast while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Dualcast</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
