msgid "Summons the faerie <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Eos</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to fight at your side. Each time you use a healing action on an ally, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Eos</ui-edge-color></ui-color> will execute <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Embrace</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on the same target.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Faerie Gauge Cost:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10<br>Depletes <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Faerie Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 10 periodically while summoned."
